<i>♪ I wasn't thinkin' about you
I wasn't ♪</i>

936
01:25:13.692 --> 01:25:17.529
<i>♪ And we break downstairs
With our fevers in the air ♪</i>

937
01:25:17.613 --> 01:25:21.450
<i>♪ I forgot to ask
How I only left them there ♪</i>

938
